  m_text: 'LEVEL 2: TRAFFIC LIGHT



    Red Light Rules:

    Do NOT cross on red!
    You will get a fine immediately.



    Vehicle Upgrades:

    Use the Upgrade
    Button to improve your car. Choose your upgrades wisely to drive smarter and
    more efficiently.



    Game Over:

    If you run out of fuel, or run too many
    red lights, you lose. Drive smart!'
